<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
  .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group input[type="date"] { width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .radio-group label { font-weight: normal; display: inline-block; margin-right: 15px; }
  .line-break { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">AUDIO SERVICES REQUEST FORM</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>Please use this form when requesting audio services for Music Department concerts and recitals. It would be greatly appreciated if you could complete this form when planning your event, but if that's not possible, please give me at least two weeks advance notice.</p>
    <p>Thanks, <span data-field="sender_name">{{ sender_name }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Name:</label>
      <div class="line-break" data-field="name">{{ name }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Group:</label>
      <div class="line-break" data-field="group">{{ group }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Event Date:</label>
      <div class="line-break" data-field="event_date">{{ event_date }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Event Location:</label>
      <div class="line-break" data-field="event_location">{{ event_location }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <label>Start Time:</label>
        <div class="line-break" data-field="start_time">{{ start_time }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <label>Dates:</label>
        <div class="line-break" data-field="dates">{{ dates }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>End Time:</label>
      <div class="line-break" data-field="end_time">{{ end_time }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Do you wish for <span data-field="audio_tech_needed">{{ audio_tech_needed }}</span> specifically to record this event? <span data-field="yes_no_recording">{{ yes_no_recording }}</span> <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="yes_no_recording">{{ yes_no_recording }}</span> <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <p>If "NO" then another trained audio technician may record the event.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>What days and times are reserved for the event so that equipment may be set up?</p>
      <div class="line-break" style="width: 100%;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Is there a Dress Rehearsal? <span data-field="dress_rehearsal_yes">{{ dress_rehearsal_yes }}</span> <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="dress_rehearsal_yes">{{ dress_rehearsal_yes }}</span> <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <div class="line-break" style="width: 100%;" data-field="is_there_a_dress_rehearsal">{{ is_there_a_dress_rehearsal }}</div>
      <p>If YES, when/where is it?</p>
      <div class="line-break" style="width: 100%;" data-field="if_yes_when_where_is_it">{{ if_yes_when_where_is_it }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>DO you need any sound reinforcement for the event? (PA, microphones, etc.) <span data-field="sound_reinforcement_no">{{ sound_reinforcement_no }}</span> <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="sound_reinforcement_yes">{{ sound_reinforcement_yes }}</span> <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <p>If YES, I will contact you to discuss</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Do you need an electronic keyboard? (Yamaha Motif 8) <span data-field="keyboard_no">{{ keyboard_no }}</span> <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="keyboard_yes">{{ keyboard_yes }}</span> <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <p>If YES, I will contact you to discuss</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>FACULTY MEMBER: How many additional copies of the CD do you wish for yourself? <div class="line-break" style="width: 50%;" data-field="field_2">{{ field_2 }}</div></p>
      <p>STUDENT: How many additional copies do you wish? <div class="line-break" style="width: 50%;" data-field="field_3">{{ field_3 }}</div> Extras are available for $<span data-field="extra_copy_cost">{{ extra_copy_cost }}</span>.</p>
      <p>If you wish them mailed please supply info below:</p>
      <div class="line-break" style="width: 100%;" data-field="extras_are_available_for">{{ extras_are_available_for }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <p>If there is anything else that you think might be helpful for me to know, please provide a brief description on the back of this page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>